
ERROR: No check_host

Verify live server serves the ordered cert.
renew-all checks every configured check_host after renewing and exits 1 on failure.

Examples:
  ./certx.sh cert mycert check_host 10.0.0.5:8443             # any host and port
  ./certx.sh cert mail check_host mail.example.com:587 smtp   # STARTTLS (smtp, imap, ftp, ..)

